{"id": "t150-001", "text": "Lunch with Siobhan. She's gone fully vegan since the summer and says oat milk is the only one that doesn't split in coffee.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siobhan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "oat milk", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t150-002", "text": "Abdi's birthday is next Saturday. Remind me to order the cake on Wednesday and pick it up the morning of.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abdi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "order the cake", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick it up", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t150-006", "text": "Long call with Natasha tonight. Her mum has a hip operation next Tuesday and she's driving down to Cardiff the day before to stay with her. She's worried because her mum is diabetic and the last anaesthetic didn't go well. Her brother Gareth can't get time off, so it's all on her. I should text her that evening to see how it went, and maybe send something for her mum a few days afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Natasha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip operation", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down to Cardiff", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "diabetic", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something for her mum", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days afterwards", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t150-007", "text": "Jack doesn't drink anymore, he's been sober for two years. Get some alcohol-free beer in for the barbecue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sober", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "two years"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Get some alcohol-free beer in", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t150-009", "text": "Bogdan's dog Pickle had her teeth out yesterday. He said she's sulking but eating again.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had her teeth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t150-011", "text": "Carmen loves salted caramel anything. Also hates coriander with a passion, so no Thai green curry when she comes over.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "salted caramel", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates coriander", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "when she comes over"}]}
{"id": "t150-014", "text": "Ibrahim is fasting for a few days next week, so don't suggest lunch. Maybe a coffee after sunset instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fasting", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "a coffee", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after sunset", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t150-031", "text": "Coffee with Siobhan and Abdi. Siobhan is moving to Glasgow at the end of the month for a new job, and Abdi is gutted. We should do a leaving dinner for her the weekend before she goes. Abdi says she loves dim sum, so maybe the place on Baker Street. I need to book it by Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siobhan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abdi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siobhan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abdi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "do a leaving dinner for her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before she goes", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abdi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "dim sum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t150-040", "text": "Bumped into Ibrahim and his wife at the market on Saturday. They're expecting twins in March! He's thrilled and slightly terrified, and she's had awful morning sickness, can barely keep anything down except ginger biscuits and plain rice. They're also trying to move to a bigger flat before the babies arrive. Maybe I could help with packing the weekend they move.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting twins", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "morning sickness", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "can barely keep anything down except ginger biscuits and plain rice", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move to a bigger flat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the babies arrive", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "help with packing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend they move", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t150-041", "text": "Akira hates surprises, so absolutely no surprise party for his birthday on the 22nd. He'd much rather a quiet ramen dinner with a few of us, Seo-yeon, Zhang and me probably. He doesn't eat pork, so it has to be the place with the chicken paitan. I need to book a table for that Friday and remind everyone the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates surprises", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiet ramen dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Seo-yeon", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat pork", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book a table", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "remind everyone", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t150-043", "text": "Mihai is vegetarian but eats fish. Prefers red wine, Pinot Noir especially.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eats fish", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "red wine", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Pinot Noir", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t150-049", "text": "Zhang mentioned he's been learning to make dumplings from his grandmother over video calls. He's proud of the pleats now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "make dumplings", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud of the pleats", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t150-052", "text": "Lunch with Malik went on longer than planned. His brother Ibrahim has his medical school interview a week on Monday, and their mum is apparently more nervous than he is. Malik wants to take him out for a curry the night before to keep him calm. I should send Ibrahim a quick message afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "medical school interview", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week on Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Ibrahim a quick message", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t150-053", "text": "Juan's daughter Lila graduated from Leeds yesterday. He sent about thirty photos. I must send congratulations to them both.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Juan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lila", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduated from Leeds", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send congratulations to them both", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t150-059", "text": "Nasser and his girlfriend split up last weekend. He's putting on a brave face but I could tell he's not okay. I'll take him for a coffee on Sunday. He also said he's thinking of moving back to Bristol after Christmas, near his parents, which honestly might help. Don't push him on it though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting on a brave face", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t150-060", "text": "Spoke to Kate's mum briefly at the school gates. She's got her knee replacement on the 2nd and will be out of action for six weeks. Kate is going to cover the school runs and is already stretched thin. Offer to do Wednesdays for a bit, and remind me to drop round a lasagne the week after the operation.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee replacement", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "out of action", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stretched thin", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Offer to do Wednesdays", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a bit", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round a lasagne", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after the operation", "anchor": "a2"}]}
